From: Mini Duck maintainers
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] fix(telemetry): express joint wrenches at hinge anchors

Translate COM-based spatial moments to joint anchors in world axes.
Record the wrench reference frame and verify against MuJoCo site sensors.

